                <pb facs="0288" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg184"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Form of certificate to be attached to a passport
                        application when a notary public or other officer authorized to administer
                        oaths is not accessible to the applicant.</hi></head>
                <p>I, the undersigned, do hereby certify and affirm that the matters stated in my
                    application for a passport of date ————, are true; and I do hereby consent that
                    this statement shall, in all respects, be held and treated as if I had
                    personally executed such application before a consul of the United States.</p>
                <closer>——— ———.<lb/>Witness:<lb/>——— ———.<lb/>——— ———.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
